Jump Game (LeetCode 55)


Track the farthest index reachable.

Java Code
class Solution {
    public boolean canJump(int[] nums) {

        int maxReach = 0;

        for(int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++){
            if(i > maxReach) return false;

            maxReach = Math.max(maxReach, i + nums[i]);
        }

        return true;
    }
}

Time Complexity: O(n)
